.!*

# Compiled Go binaries (from `go build .` at repo root or `go build ./cmd/xxx`).
# GitHub warns on files >50MB; these arm64 binaries are ~50-60MB each.
# The build tools land binaries either at repo root (name from module) or
# next to the cmd package (name from directory), so cover both.
/admin
/billing
/frontend
/gateway
/tester
cmd/admin/admin
cmd/billing/billing
cmd/frontend/frontend
cmd/gateway/gateway
cmd/tester/tester

