docs/plans/

# Terraform
infra/.terraform/
infra/.terraform.lock.hcl
infra/terraform.tfvars
infra/*.tfstate
infra/*.tfstate.*
infra/tfplan
infra/*.tfplan
# Local-only artifact written by terraform/tofu when an apply errors
# mid-way (contains IAM bindings + provider identities). Already
# covered by the *.tfstate.* glob above; called out explicitly so
# nobody is tempted to `git add` it past the catch-all.
infra/errored.tfstate*
# Generated by Cloud Build (build-services-tfvars step) and
# reconstructed locally before any out-of-band `terraform apply`
# so the plan doesn't propose to destroy live Cloud Run services.
infra/services.auto.tfvars.json
# Nested .terraform/ dirs created by terraform when modules use the
# google provider for `data` lookups (e.g. cloud-run-services).
infra/modules/*/.terraform/
infra/modules/*/.terraform.lock.hcl
tests/
